  "label": "Scientific Falsity: Claim that '666 is the chemical make up of black people'",
  "description": "The meme falsely claims that the atomic composition of carbon (6 protons, 6 neutrons, 6 electrons) represents Black people. This is a scientifically baseless and racist pseudoscience, deliberately misusing chemistry to dehumanize a racial group. Understanding this requires knowledge of atomic structure and the concept of racial pseudoscience.",
